!! Plane Geometry

equilateral triangle, regular pentagon, regular hexagon, etc. = ''cibypitkubli'', ''mumpitkubli'', ''xavypitkubli'' ...

{ALINK(aname=cuktai)}circle = cuktai{ALINK}
{ALINK(aname=linji)}line = linji{ALINK}
{ALINK(aname=mokca)}point = mokca{ALINK}

{ANAME()}mokca{ANAME}
__mokca__

x1 is a point/instant/moment (0-dimensional shape/form) in/on/at time/place x2.

{ANAME()}linji{ANAME}
__linji__

x1 is a line/among lines (1-dimensional shape/form) defined by set of points x2.

{ANAME()}cuktai{ANAME}
__cuktai__

t1=c1 is a circle.

----

!! Solid Geometry

__pirmidi__

^x1 is a pyramid of base/side x2 and height x3^

!! Analytic Geometry

x-axis, y-axis, z-axis = ''pavromli'i, relromli'i, cibromli'i''